The MIT licence covers the code in this repository only.

It does not cover the model weights this project downloads at runtime, which carry their
own licences — MuQ-MuLan is CC-BY-NC, so commercial use of that component is not permitted
by its authors.

It does not cover the music. No audio is distributed here. `demo/personal_vectors.npz`
holds numerical embeddings derived from commercially released recordings; the recordings
themselves, and their lyrics, are not included and are not redistributed.
